WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.205
Pig and Dog were playing catch.

2
00:00:08.206 --> 00:00:13.338
"Good throw, Pig," said Dog.

3
00:00:13.339 --> 00:00:16.796
"Good catch, Dog," said Pig.

4
00:00:16.797 --> 00:00:22.481
"We are a good team."

5
00:00:22.482 --> 00:00:25.752
Cat woke up.

6
00:00:25.753 --> 00:00:30.587
She saw Pig and Dog playing.

7
00:00:30.588 --> 00:00:41.790
"Can I play catch too?" asked Cat.

8
00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:44.495
"Okay," said Pig.

9
00:00:44.496 --> 00:00:47.611
"Okay," said Dog.

10
00:00:47.612 --> 00:00:54.536
Cat threw the ball to Pig.

11
00:00:54.537 --> 00:00:57.783
"Too high!" called Pig.

12
00:00:57.784 --> 00:01:05.445
Cat threw the ball to Dog.

13
00:01:05.446 --> 00:01:08.199
"Too low!" called Dog.

14
00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:13.596
Dog threw the ball to Cat.

15
00:01:13.597 --> 00:01:17.086
Cat missed it.

16
00:01:17.087 --> 00:01:22.834
Pig threw the ball to Cat.

17
00:01:22.835 --> 00:01:27.347
Cat missed it again.

18
00:01:27.348 --> 00:01:30.220
Cat could not throw.

19
00:01:30.221 --> 00:01:32.883
Cat could not catch.

20
00:01:32.884 --> 00:01:43.169
But she liked chasing the ball!

21
00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:51.818
Soon the game was over.

22
00:01:51.819 --> 00:01:54.575
"Catch is fun," Cat said.

23
00:01:54.576 --> 00:01:57.072
"Can I play again?"

24
00:01:57.073 --> 00:02:05.336
"Um . . . Maybe," said Pig.

25
00:02:05.337 --> 00:02:11.620
"We'll see," said Dog.

